OL,3,GNEWSANo compulsory redundancies from
OL,4,Ahealth board cuts - Swinney
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe first minister has promised his
OL,7,Fplans to reduce the number of health
OL,8,Fboards in Scotland will not result in
OL,9,Fcompulsory redundancies.
OL,11,FJohn Swinney would not be drawn on the
OL,12,Fscale of job losses likely following
OL,13,Fhis proposals to cut the number of
OL,14,Fmainland boards from 14 to two.
OL,16,FHe told BBC's Radio Scotland Breakfast
OL,17,Fhe would "work collaboratively" with
OL,18,Ftrade unions on a reform programme that
OL,19,Fwill mean a reduction in public sector
OL,20,Fjobs.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
