OL,3,GNEWSANo compulsory redundancies from
OL,4,Ahealth board cuts - Swinney
OL,5,
OL,6,FSwinney said: "I will maintain the no
OL,7,Fcompulsory redundancy commitment. There
OL,8,Fis no question about that in my mind."
